OL,5,G0132 More than the Score
OL,6,     FDiscus thrower Alex Rose won
OL,7,     FSamoa's first ever medal at a
OL,8,     FWorld Athletics Championship,
OL,9,     Fwhile also working full time. Ade
OL,10,     FAdedoyin hears how he balances his
OL,11,     Fmany priorities.
OL,12,G0150 Sporting Witness
OL,13,     FOn 15 October 1981, at a baseball
OL,14,     Fgame between the Oakland Athletics
OL,15,     Fand the New York Yankees in the
OL,16,     FUSA, fans stood up and sat down in
OL,17,     Fsections around the stadium.
